&lt;h3 class="relative group"&gt;District Overview
 &lt;div id="district-overview" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 
 &lt;span
 class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;
 &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#district-overview" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
 &lt;/span&gt;
 
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Anne Arundel County Public Schools&lt;/strong&gt; serves approximately 55,000+ students across 80+ schools. As one of Maryland&amp;rsquo;s largest and highest-performing districts, AACPS offers diverse educational options for students from kindergarten through 12th grade.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Schools &amp; Education Pathways in Anne Arundel County</title><link>https://annearundelguide.com/topics/schools-education-pathways/</link><pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://annearundelguide.com/topics/schools-education-pathways/</guid><description>&lt;h1 class="relative group"&gt;Schools &amp;amp; Education Pathways in Anne Arundel County
 &lt;div id="schools--education-pathways-in-anne-arundel-county" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 
 &lt;span
 class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;
 &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#schools--education-pathways-in-anne-arundel-county" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
 &lt;/span&gt;
 
&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Estimated reading time: 6 minutes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a mother of three children who has navigated the Anne Arundel County school system for over a decade, I know how overwhelming choosing the right school can be. You&amp;rsquo;re not just picking a building with a name on the sign - you&amp;rsquo;re choosing your child&amp;rsquo;s social environment, their academic foundation, and often, where you&amp;rsquo;ll spend the next several years living.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>AACPS Enrollment Guide</title><link>https://annearundelguide.com/topics/enrollment-guide/</link><pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://annearundelguide.com/topics/enrollment-guide/</guid><description>&lt;h1 class="relative group"&gt;AACPS Enrollment Guide
 &lt;div id="aacps-enrollment-guide" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 
 &lt;span
 class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;
 &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#aacps-enrollment-guide" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
 &lt;/span&gt;
 
&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Enrolling your child in Anne Arundel County Public Schools requires specific documentation and following the right process. This guide walks through what you need and when to do it.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2 class="relative group"&gt;Determining Your School Zone
 &lt;div id="determining-your-school-zone" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 
